# Service-account credentials. A Google service-account JSON is a live
# private key: anything holding one must never be committed, and the
# filename Google hands you (project-hash.json) is easy to drop into the
# repo root without noticing. Match the shapes rather than one name.
*-*.json.key
*service-account*.json
*credentials*.json
gcp-*.json
dev-abhay-*.json
vertex-*.json
uploads/homework/*
!uploads/homework/.gitkeep
